# TELETEXT LIVES — .gitignore
#
# HACKATHON RULE: /.kiro must NEVER be ignored.
# The Kiroween rules require /.kiro to be present in the public repo
# as evidence of genuine Kiro usage. Do not add it here.

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Linux
*~

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Editor and IDE directories
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Node (not used in this project, but guard against accidental init)
node_modules/
